---
import Layout from '../../../../layouts/Layout.astro';

const COMPASS_URL = 'https://redefiningretirement.io/products/the-gen-exit-compass';
---

<Layout
  title="You're In | Redefining Retirement"
  description="Your Gen eXit Playbook is on its way — plus a one-time offer on The Gen eXit Compass."
  type="website"
  noindex={true}
  bare={true}
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container ty-container">
      <p class="ty-eyebrow">Thanks for signing up!</p>
      <h1 class="ty-headline">Your <strong>Gen eXit Playbook</strong> is on its way to your inbox right now.</h1>
      <p class="ty-subhead">I can't wait for you to dig in. But this brings me to an important question…</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section oto-section">
    <div class="container prose oto-prose">
      <span class="oto-badge">One-Time Offer:</span>
      <h2 class="oto-headline">Want My Gen eXit Compass For Only $27 (60% Off)?</h2>

      <div class="quiz-block">
        <p><strong>Pop quiz:</strong> What's the #1 most important thing for planning your next chapter in 2026?</p>
        <ul>
          <li>A) Maxing out your 401(k) and "saving harder"</li>
          <li>B) Polishing your résumé and updating LinkedIn</li>
          <li>C) Picking a hot side-hustle everyone's talking about</li>
          <li>D) Just gutting it out until you're old enough to retire</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="quiz-answer"><strong>Answer:</strong> None of the above.</p>
      </div>

      <p>Instead, <span class="highlight">the #1 most important thing is finding a direction that AI can't replace — and that you'd actually be glad to do for the rest of your working life</span> — before you build anything.</p>

      <p>This is the whole ballgame. Because if you're going to put in the time to play offense, the worst thing you can do is pour a year into the wrong thing and quit at month four.</p>

      <p><strong>And it dictates the answers to ALL the other questions…</strong> like what to build, which skills to lean on, what to learn, and where the money actually is — and so much more.</p>

      <p>Now, The Gen Exit Playbook on its way to your inbox covers the basics — the offense-vs-defense shift and the 5 plays for building income beside your job…</p>

      <p>But if you're serious about building a second act you'd never want to retire from…</p>

      <p>And want to follow a proven, step-by-step process to find your direction…</p>

      <p>Instead of staring at the ceiling wondering "what would I even do?"…</p>

      <p>Then I've got great news for you.</p>

      <p class="intro-label">Introducing</p>
      <h3 class="intro-headline"><span class="product-badge">The Gen eXit Compass</span></h3>

      <img
        class="compass-cover"
        src="/images/compass/gen-exit-compass-cover.jpg"
        alt="The Gen eXit Compass workbook cover"
        loading="lazy"
      />

      <p>Inside, you'll discover:</p>

      <ul class="check-list">
        <li><strong>How to run your 25 years of experience through 7 plug-in AI prompts</strong> to surface a direction that's yours — no blank page, no guessing</li>
        <li>The AI Rory Test — how to aim at the kind of work AI can't touch (so you're not building on ground that's about to disappear)</li>
        <li><strong>The Ikigai Intersection</strong> — pinpoint the overlap where what you're good at, what you love, what's needed, and what pays all meet</li>
        <li>How to turn that direction into 3 real, demand-validated opportunities — ranked by which one you could test the fastest</li>
        <li>BONUS: Your fill-in "My North Star" page — so you walk away holding an actual document, not a vague feeling</li>
      </ul>

      <p>I've reinvented myself more than once — foundry worker, 17-year mechanical draftsman, and now a guy who gets paid on his own terms…</p>

      <p>And I distilled the exact thought exercises and AI prompts I've used (the same ones a reader told me "may have saved my career") into a simple, do-it-in-one-sitting workbook…</p>

      <p>So you can finally name the direction worth building toward.</p>

      <p>Even if you have no idea what you'd do right now…</p>

      <p>And even if you've convinced yourself it's "too late" or that ship sailed for your generation.</p>

      <p>Just imagine waking up on a Monday with no pit in your stomach — because instead of dreading another standup where someone half your age reassigns your priorities, you've got a direction on paper you're genuinely fired up about.</p>

      <p>That's what I'm offering you here today.</p>

      <p>Now, you're probably wondering how much this costs…</p>

      <p>Well, people pay me $200+ an hour for one-on-one AI training to do exactly this kind of thinking…</p>

      <p>Which is why they're happy to pay that rate to have me in the room with them.</p>

      <p>But obviously I'm not gonna charge you that.</p>

      <p>Because I'm not sitting across from you doing it for you — I've packaged the whole process so you can run it yourself.</p>

      <p>Heck, I'm not even gonna charge you the $97 this easily could've sold for…</p>

      <p>Even though I spent years figuring out these exercises the hard way, and hours distilling them into something you can finish tonight…</p>

      <p>Not to mention that picking the right direction up front saves you the months (and the savings) most people burn on the wrong one… and it turns the experience you already have into your single biggest advantage in the AI era.</p>

      <p>And this will help you find a direction for yourself…</p>

      <p>Without wasting another year spinning your wheels.</p>

      <p>Look, here's the honest truth:</p>

      <p>When you grab your copy today, you won't even pay half of that…</p>

      <p>Because I know once I've helped you solve THIS problem — finding your direction…</p>

      <p>You'll be far more likely to let me help you with the bigger one next: actually building the thing.</p>

      <p>So, drum roll please…</p>

      <p class="price-reveal">Your investment today is just… <strong>$27.</strong></p>

      <p>That's it.</p>

      <p>Less than a single hour with a career coach who'd just hand you a personality test and a worksheet…</p>

      <p>And without the awkward "so, what brings you in today?" small talk ;)</p>

      <p>So there's no reason to wait.</p>

      <p>Plus, if for some reason you're not satisfied, just email me at <a href="mailto:coreysretirement@fastmail.com">coreysretirement@fastmail.com</a> and I'll refund your purchase with no hassles, headaches, or questions asked.</p>

      <p>But just a heads up… <strong>This is a one-time-only offer for new subscribers.</strong> It's only available right here on this page. You won't find it anywhere else on the internet.</p>

      <p><strong>So if you've read this far, it's clear you understand how crucial it is to find a direction that's AI-proof — and worth doing — in 2026.</strong> Not to mention why you'd want to follow a proven process… Instead of trying to reinvent the wheel (or worse, doing nothing and gutting it out till 67).</p>

      <div class="testimonial-block">
        <p>"Corey, this column may have saved my career. The AI Rory prompt helped put something in perspective for me about my new job and guided how I'm going to approach it going forward. I can't explain it without giving you a ton of detail, but I just wanted to say thank you!"</p>
        <span class="testimonial-attr">— Andy Klungland</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="container">
      <div class="cta-block oto-cta">
        <h2>Complete Your Order Now to Get Your Discounted Copy Before This Offer Disappears</h2>
        <p class="price-line"><span class="price-was">$67</span> <span class="price-now">$27</span></p>
        <a class="btn btn-cta" href={COMPASS_URL} id="compass-cta-btn">⚡ Get The Gen eXit Compass For $27 →</a>
        <p class="cta-trust">** 30-Day Money-Back Guarantee ** &nbsp; ** 100% Safe and Secure Checkout **</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<script is:inline>
  (function () {
    window.dataLayer = window.dataLayer || [];

    // Carry UTM + fbclid params through to the Beehiiv checkout link.
    var btn = document.getElementById('compass-cta-btn');
    if (btn) {
      var params = new URLSearchParams(window.location.search);
      var passthrough = new URLSearchParams();
      params.forEach(function (value, key) {
        if (key.indexOf('utm_') === 0 || key === 'fbclid' || key === 'gclid') {
          passthrough.append(key, value);
        }
      });
      if ([...passthrough].length) {
        var url = new URL(btn.href);
        passthrough.forEach(function (value, key) { url.searchParams.set(key, value); });
        btn.href = url.toString();
      }

      btn.addEventListener('click', function () {
        window.dataLayer.push({
          event: 'begin_checkout',
          ecommerce: {
            currency: 'USD',
            value: 27,
            items: [{ item_id: 'gen-exit-compass', item_name: 'The Gen eXit Compass', price: 27, quantity: 1 }],
          },
        });
      });
    }
  })();
</script>

<style>
  .ty-container {
    max-width: 720px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .ty-eyebrow {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--blue);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .ty-headline {
    font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 5vw, 2.6rem);
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .ty-subhead {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  .oto-section {
    padding-top: 0;
  }

  .oto-prose {
    max-width: 640px;
  }

  .oto-badge {
    display: block;
    width: fit-content;
    margin: 0 auto 0.75rem;
    background: var(--blue);
    color: #ffffff;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    padding: 0.4rem 1rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
  }

  .oto-headline {
    text-align: center;
    margin-top: 0 !important;
    font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 2.1rem);
  }

  .highlight {
    color: var(--blue);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .quiz-block {
    background: var(--bg-subtle);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: 1.5rem 1.5rem 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .quiz-block ul {
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .quiz-answer {
    margin-bottom: 0 !important;
  }

  .intro-label {
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem !important;
  }

  .intro-headline {
    text-align: center;
  }

  .product-badge {
    display: inline-block;
    background: var(--bg-subtle);
    border: 1px solid var(--blue);
    color: var(--text);
    padding: 0.4rem 1rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius);
  }

  .compass-cover {
    max-width: 280px;
    margin: 0 auto 1.5rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    box-shadow: 0 12px 30px -10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25);
  }

  .check-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding-left: 0;
  }

  .check-list li {
    padding-left: 1.6rem;
    position: relative;
    margin-bottom: 0.85rem;
  }

  .check-list li::before {
    content: '✅';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 0;
  }

  .price-reveal {
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 1.15rem;
  }

  .oto-cta {
    text-align: center;
  }

  .price-line {
    font-size: 1.6rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem !important;
  }

  .price-was {
    text-decoration: line-through;
    color: var(--text-light);
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    margin-right: 0.5rem;
  }

  .price-now {
    color: var(--blue);
  }

  .btn-cta {
    height: 56px;
    padding: 0 2rem;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .cta-trust {
    margin-top: 0.85rem !important;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--text-light);
  }

  .testimonial-block {
    padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
    border-left: 4px solid var(--blue);
    background: var(--bg-subtle);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    margin: 2rem 0;
  }

  .testimonial-block p {
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: var(--text);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .testimonial-attr {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }
</style>
